    <innerclass refid="class_non_decay" prot="public">NonDecay</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_non_decay" kindref="compound">NonDecay</ref> class, representing a model with no decay effect. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_non_decay" kindref="compound">NonDecay</ref> class is a concrete implementation of the abstract <ref refid="class_decay" kindref="compound">Decay</ref> class where no decay is applied. It simply returns the input value unchanged. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
